B.a8a=new A.V(B.aaC,["Lumi\xe8re Intelligence","A clear view of what is supported, what has changed, and what to do next.","Current picture","Priorities now","What changed","What Lumi\xe8re is watching","Routine context","Product connection","Next check","Outlook","History, trajectory and uncertainty\u2014kept clearly separate.","Trajectory","Signal explorer","Observed history","Illustrative outlook","No outlook available","Illustrative device-demo history. No photo was analyzed, no provider was called, and these values are not measurements.","Your intelligence timeline starts here","A supported first observation can establish a starting point. Lumi\xe8re will not show change or outlook before the data can support it.","Intelligence is unavailable right now. No estimate has been substituted.","Your fixture history shows a clear current focus, one steady signal, and a calm next step.","One observation is a starting point, not a trend.","Another compatible check-in is needed before Lumi\xe8re can compare change.","A future compatible check-in can test whether the current pattern continues.","Moisture appearance is the clearest current priority.","Lumi\xe8re keeps this cosmetic observation separate from comfort, health, or diagnosis.","Texture appearance is being watched over time.","Only compatible observations are placed on this trajectory.","Tone appearance looks relatively consistent across this fixture history.","Stability can be useful without being turned into a score.","Your tracked moisture step was active during this period. This does not prove causation.","Your evening routine was tracked during this period. Lumi\xe8re does not attribute the change to one step.","A moisture-support category relates to this priority; live product claims are not connected.","Observed","Fixture estimate\u2014not a prediction","Waiting for more compatible history","Moving in a positive direction","Appears stable","Worth closer attention","Newly observed","No longer observed","Not enough comparable history","Insufficient data","Limited history","Early signal","Moderate history","Strong history","First analysis","Early history","Rich history","Mixed signals","Insufficient data","Today","14 days","30 days","60 days","90 days","Observed","Estimated fixture","Low-confidence fixture","Unavailable","Waiting for more data"],t.w)
